2 TITL Phillip & Mary Fetterly
1 _OID 022d195b-12bc-45a7-bc6b-b5fa1ee01a4d
1 PLAC May Corner Marinette County Wisconsin, USA
1 _DSCR PHILIP FETTERLY, farmer, of Section 12, Peshtigo, Wisconsin, has 240 acres. He was born in Canada and came to Peshtigo in 1861 and engaged with the Peshtigo Company, lumbering for about two years; then commenced to improve his farm. He has one of t
2 CONC he finest apple orchards in the county. He has served the office of treasurer of his school district for three years. He has eight children--Elizabeth (Mrs. Charles Paetz), Elias C., George J.(1856), Allen, William (1863), Charles, Frank and Eddie/
2 CONC Edwin.
