1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;span style="color: #0b00e0;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt; 177. Catlyntje &amp;lt;Jan&amp;gt; Voorhees Van Arsdale (Rn=6335), who was born 08 June 1719 and died before 1736 at 16 years of age. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;
2 CONC nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; She married 08 June 1719 Dirck &amp;lt;Cornelis&amp;gt; Van Arsdale (Rn=18421), who was born 1693, a son of Cornelis &amp;lt;Simon&amp;gt; Van Arsdale (Rn=5345) and Marritje &amp;lt;Dirck&amp;gt; Amerma
2 CONC n Van Arsdale (Rn=5380).&amp;nbsp; Source [The Van Voorhees Family by Elias Van Voorhis&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; 1888 page 367]&amp;nbsp; Source [The Van Voorhees Family in America by Florence A Christop
2 CONC h 2000 page 76]&amp;nbsp; Source [Record: April 1951 page 110]&amp;nbsp; Source [The De Grauw Family by Colista E B Stuewer 1985 929.273D364s page 99]&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nb
