2 TITL Edward Savage, Veteran, Dies
1 _OID 13a8b7ba-352f-487f-9976-b04b32f2970b
1 _DSCR Obituary, watertown daily times
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;br&gt;(1928)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Edward Savage, Veteran, Dies&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(special to the times)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Chaumont, Feb 7- Edward Savage, 84 died at his home in the town of Hounsfied early Monday morn
2 CONC ing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mr. Savage was born May 26, 1843 in the town of Brownville where he lived until he was two years of age. He then moved into the town of Hounsfield with his parents. He remained there for the remainder of his life with the ex
2 CONC ception of three years spent in the army during the Civil war. He was a member of Company H, 10th New York Artiliery,. He lived for seven years in Jersey City, N.J.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;He was honary member of Brownville Masonic Lodge No. 53 F. and A
2 CONC .M., a member of Watertown Grange and of the GAR post of Dexter.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Surviving are the following children: May D. Savage and Edward G. Savage who lived home, John Savage of Muscalong, Mrs. Grace J. Wallace of Brownville, George W. Sa
2 CONC vage of Minneapolis, Minn., Mrs. Emma M. Brooks of East Rodman, Mrs. Eva B. Ellison [Allison] of Limmerick, Arthur E. Savage of Rochester and nine grandchildren. His wife, Emma Mary Savage, died on Sept 28, 1927.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Funeral Service
2 CONC s will be held Thursday at 2pm from the home with interment in Brownville.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Card of thanks&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We wish to than the Sons of Veterans, Masons, The Watertown Grange, also our friends and neighbors for their kind expres
2 CONC sions of sypathy and floral offerings, especially the use of cars in the sad loss of our beloved father, Edward Savage.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;John Savage&lt;br&gt;Edward G. Savage&lt;br&gt;George W. Savage&lt;br&gt;Arthur E. Savage&lt;br&gt;Grace J. W
2 CONC allace&lt;br&gt;Emma Brooks&lt;br&gt;May D., Ferguson&lt;br&gt;Eva B. Allison&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hounsfield, NY Feb 16, 1928&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;!--body: end--&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
