1 _DSCR John states in his 1807 Petition to be added to the U.E. List that he spent time in jail for siding with the British during the Revolutionary War.  John's brother Peter Fetterly enlisted on 26 Oct. 1779 1st Battalion KRRNY, returned to the U.S whe
2 CONC n the war was ended and married Hannah Baseler in 1786, later settling in Wiliamsburg Twp., Canada.  John Fetterly settled in Osnabruck Twp. in 1795.
