2 CONC amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;FATHER: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;John Bacon&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; [2/1092/3]; b. 1628 , , England; d. 17-Jun-1683 Dedham, Norfolk, Massachusetts; m. 17-Feb-1651 De
2 CONC dham, Norfolk, Massachusetts;&lt;/span&gt; PARENTS: Michael Bacon [2/1092] &amp;amp; Alice&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;MOTHER: &lt;strong&gt;Rebecca Hall&lt;/strong&gt; [2/1092/3]; d. 27-Oct-1694&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;hr&gt;</line><line>&lt;
2 CONC p&gt;1. &lt;strong&gt;Mary Bacon&lt;/strong&gt; [2/1092/31]; m. 14-Oct-1673 Dedham, Norfolk, Massachusetts; &lt;strong&gt;Nathaniel Kinsbury&lt;/strong&gt; [2/1092/31]; b. 1650; d. 1694&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;2. &lt;strong&gt;John Bacon&lt;
2 CONC /strong&gt; [2/1092/32]; b. 17-Jul-1656 Dedham, Norfolk, Massachusetts; d. 27-Oct-1732; m. 15-Dec-1683 Dedham, Norfolk, Massachusetts; &lt;strong&gt;Lydia Dewing&lt;/strong&gt; [2/1092/32]; b. 1660/1; d. 17-Nov-1754; &lt;em&gt;PARENTS: Andrew Dewin
2 CONC g/Duing [2/1092/320] &amp;amp; Ann Donstall, widower of Lydia Goodnow [2/1092/320a]&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;.....A. Children 1-6 Bacon [2/1092/321]; b. Dedham, Norfolk, Massachusetts&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;3. &lt;strong&gt
2 CONC ;Rebecca Bacon&lt;/strong&gt; [2/1092/33]; b. 10-Dec-1658 Dedham, Norfolk, Massachusetts; m. 13-Feb-1679 Dedham, Norfolk, Massachusetts; &lt;strong&gt;John Gay&lt;/strong&gt; [2/1092/33]; b. 1651 Dedham, Norfolk, Massachusetts; d. 1731&lt;/p&gt;</l
2 CONC ine><line>&lt;p&gt;4. &lt;strong&gt;Daniel Bacon &lt;/strong&gt;[2/1092/34]; b. 10-Mar-1661 Dedham, Norfolk, Massachusetts; d. 27-Oct-1694 Dedham, Norfolk, Massachusetts; m. 21-Apr-1685 Dedham, Norfolk, Massachusetts; &lt;strong&gt;Elizabeth Martin
