1 DATE 13 August 1649
1 PLAC New Amsterdam
1 _DSCR New York State Archives  https://iarchives.nysed.gov/xtf/view?docId=tei/A0270/NYSA_A0270-78_V3_052a.xml
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="caret-color: #2e221f; color: #2e221f; font-family: raleway, �sans-serif; font-size: 14px;"&gt;This day, date underwritten, at the office of the secretary of New Netherland and in his absence befo
2 CONC re Jacob Kip, his clerk, appeared the&amp;nbsp;worthy Jacob Jacobsz Roy, who in the presence of the undersigned witnesses transfers and conveys to and for the behoof of Abram Isaacksz &amp;nbsp;Planck, by virtue of the patent dated the 3d of July 1
2 CONC 643, and the affidavit respecting the conveyance dated the 13&lt;/span&gt;&lt;sup style="font-size: 14px; padding-right: 4px; caret-color: #2e221f; color: #2e221f; font-family: raleway, �sans-serif;"&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;span style="caret-color: #2
2 CONC e221f; color: #2e221f; font-family: raleway, �sans-serif; font-size: 14px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;of August 1649, a &amp;nbsp;certain house and garden standing and situated on the north side of Fort Amsterdam on the island of Manhatans, and that in true, ab
2 CONC solute&amp;nbsp;and rightful ownership, provided that he, Abram Planck, or whoever obtains his right, shall be subject to the reservations stipulated in said &amp;nbsp;patent. Therefore he, Jacob Roy, relinquishes the ownership of said house and lo
2 CONC t, conveying the same to the aforesaid Abram Isacksz Planck, or whoever obtains his right, in true ownership, without the grantor claiming any further interest therein, but surrendering the &amp;nbsp;same henceforth and forever. He, Jacob Jacobsz R
2 CONC oy, promises to hold and to cause to be held firm, binding and inviolable this deed, &amp;nbsp;binding himself thereto as by law provided. Without fraud or deceit this is signed by him and the witnesses this 13&lt;/span&gt;&lt;sup style="font-size
2 CONC : 14px; padding-right: 4px; caret-color: #2e221f; color: #2e221f; font-family: raleway, �sans-serif;"&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;span style="caret-color: #2e221f; color: #2e221f; font-family: raleway, �sans-serif; font-size: 14px;"&gt;of August 1649, &am
2 CONC p;nbsp;New Amsterdam.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #2e221f; font-family: raleway, �sans-serif; width: 800px; padding-bottom: 5px; caret-color: #2e221f;"&gt;Jacob Jacobsz Roy&lt;/div&gt
2 CONC ;</line><line>&lt;div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #2e221f; font-family: raleway, �sans-serif; width: 800px; padding-bottom: 5px; caret-color: #2e221f;"&gt;Claes van Elslant&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div style="font-size: 14p
