2 CONC 2723498"&gt;Elizabeth &lt;em&gt;Larkin&lt;/em&gt; Newton (1641 - 1719)&lt;/a&gt;*&lt;br&gt;&lt;a class="NoUnderline12point" href="fg.cgi?page=gr&amp;amp;GRid=32724369"&gt;Hannah &lt;em&gt;Larkin Penticost&lt;/em&gt; Newell (1643 - 1704)&lt;/a&gt;*&
2 CONC lt;br&gt;&lt;a class="NoUnderline12point" href="fg.cgi?page=gr&amp;amp;GRid=32725011"&gt;Thomas Larkin (1644 - 1677)&lt;/a&gt;*&lt;br&gt;&lt;a class="NoUnderline12point" href="fg.cgi?page=gr&amp;amp;GRid=32728835"&gt;Edward Larkin (1646 - ____)&lt;
