2 CONC ed (June 19, 1776) in&amp;nbsp;Canada&amp;nbsp;during the&amp;nbsp;American Revolutionary War.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 0.5em; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: 'helvetica neue', helvetica, 'nimbus sans l', arial, 'liberati
