2 CONC und by their shot </line><line>in his left arm. There were then slain to our great grief eight </line><line>men. viz. &amp;mdash; Zechariah Philips of Boston, Timothy Farlow,* of Bill- </line><line>ericay, Edward Coleborn, of Chelmsford, Samuel Sme
