2 TITL The Coburn Album: Sarah Jane Coburn
1 _OID f82594d1-0de1-49f0-be9d-49126388ad66
1 _DSCR The person in this tintype was identified as Sarah Jane Coburn.
2 CONT 
2 CONT The Coburn Album was a group of photographs, mostly tintypes and a few prints, containing family, relatives, and friends of the Coburn family, only some of which were actually labeled. Although the original album no longer exists, these few photogr
2 CONC aphs and namecards remain, some of which were labeled. Also included are a few photographs that were probably originally part of this album, but were subsequently stored in other files. The album most likely belonged to Sarah Jane (Coburn) Baker o
2 CONC r her daughter Anna Belle (Baker) Frank.
2 CONT 
2 CONT These photos have been edited to improve appearance.
